00:06:04,160 --> 00:06:07,360
about the relationship between scouts and leadership

122
00:06:07,360 --> 00:06:10,260
positions and the way that they develop as leaders.

123
00:06:10,360 --> 00:06:12,960
We're going to talk about what we can do as adult

