00:06:12,960 --> 00:06:16,760
volunteers to help foment this kind of youth

125
00:06:16,760 --> 00:06:17,960
leadership development.

126
00:06:18,160 --> 00:06:20,360
Event based training- the National Youth Leader

127
00:06:20,360 --> 00:06:23,760
Training like NYLT- and troop based training present

128
00:06:23,760 --> 00:06:26,160
both some experiential and some classroom

