00:06:34,360 --> 00:06:37,360
If the conditions in a scouts home troop aren't focused

133
00:06:37,360 --> 00:06:39,660
on continual leadership development, the benefits

134
00:06:39,660 --> 00:06:42,060
of training scouts by sending them to these big

